{"id":"418738","name":"山楂陈皮冬瓜排骨汤","author":"緣豆兒","authorId":"8471333","desc":"","cover":"images/418738/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"山楂干","amount":"10克"},{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"300克"},{"name":"陈皮","amount":"5克"},{"name":"猪排骨","amount":"300克"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好材料。","img":"images/418738/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"陈皮、山楂洗净先用清水浸泡15分钟左右。","img":"images/418738/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"排骨汆水备用。","img":"images/418738/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冬瓜连皮切大块。","img":"images/418738/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅中加入清水1800毫升左右，所有食材一起放进汤煲。","img":"images/418738/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"滚开后撇去浮沫，转小火煲1小时。","img":"images/418738/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"最后加盐就可以了。","img":"images/418738/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}